注意 / NOTICE

本仓库的界面布局与业务逻辑是对某同学开发的 Android 应用（Flutter release 构建）的
逆向重建产物，仅用于学习交流。仓库中不包含原始 APK，也不包含其反编译产物。

如原作者对本仓库有异议，请开 issue，维护者会立即处理（下架或补充署名）。

This repository is a reverse-engineering reconstruction of a Flutter app
developed by a fellow student, intended for study purposes only. The original
APK and any decompiled artifacts are NOT included. If you are the original
author and object to this repository, please open an issue and it will be
taken down.
